readme.text:
Each live agent gets one `system-prompt/assemble` listener registered through `agent.ctx`. That registration is scope-filtered to that agent and disposed with it, so:

- two sessions assemble two different prompts, and neither can read the other's persona;
- the listener resolves the store at every model step, so `/persona set` applies on the next step with no re-registration and no restart;
- unloading the plugin or disposing an agent removes exactly its own hook.
